6 CI,ASSWORK ON SUPERSENSORY pOWERS: 18complete insight does not come to me very often, though it happens if there is a need for meto comprehend. It is like a grft from the Higher Self, a gift of perception that came when Iachieved the ability to face reality.Concentrate, therefore, on all the myriad forms and conditions that surround you.Reach for the ability to see the infinite number of details that usually escape you. Thus willyou prepare yourself for extending your range of vision and finally achieve the capacity tosee on the highest levels of your being.
